{:edb/db-before-t 1485 :edb/db-after-t 1486 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534798 50 #inst "2026-10-12T14:43:48.924Z" 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186153928 1075 #edb/ref 17592186153929 13194139534798 17592186045417 false] [17592186153928 1075 #edb/ref 17592186153930 13194139534798 17592186045417 false] [17592186153928 1075 #edb/ref 17592186153931 13194139534798 17592186045417 false] [17592186153928 1075 #edb/ref 17592186153932 13194139534798 17592186045417 false] [17592186153928 1075 #edb/ref 17592186153933 13194139534798 17592186045417 false] [17592186153928 1075 #edb/ref 17592186436379 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186153928 1075 #edb/ref 17592186436380 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186153928 1075 #edb/ref 17592186436382 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186153928 1075 #edb/ref 17592186436383 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186153928 1075 #edb/ref 17592186436386 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186153928 1078 #edb/ref 17592186436383 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186157249 1038 #edb/ref 17592186436389 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186157614 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186157614 1071 "![](images/33/33e48fa5bdbb034bcf489e038ccf80fc5f67baabeccacc1b7abd741183ebf05d.png)\n\nConsider the square region $Δ$ and its **directed** boundary $∂Δ$ in the $uv$-plane, where $Δ$ is given by\n\n$$\nΔ=\\{(u,v)\\,:\\,0\\le u\\le 1,\\,0\\le v\\le 1\\},\n$$\n\nand the transformation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT:(u,v)\\to (x(u,v),y(u,v)),\n$$\n\nwhere \n\n$$\nx=v,\\,y=u-{v}^{2}.\n$$\n\nThe image of the side ${S}_{3}$ under the action of $T$ is a **directed** line segment. Find the endpoints of this segment, stated in the order that they are traversed." 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186157614 1071 "![](images/33/33e48fa5bdbb034bcf489e038ccf80fc5f67baabeccacc1b7abd741183ebf05d.png)\n\nConsider the square region $Δ$ and its **directed** boundary $∂Δ$ in the $uv$-plane, where $Δ$ is given by\n$Δ = {(u, v): 0 \\le u \\le 1, 0 \\le v \\le 1}$,\n\nand the transformation $T$, given by\n$T: (u, v) → (x(u, v), y(u, v))$,\nwhere\n$x = v, y = u - v^{2}$.\n\nThe image of the side $S_{3}$ under the action of $T$ is a **directed** line segment. Find the endpoints of this segment, stated in the order that they are traversed." 13194139534798 17592186045417 false] [17592186157614 1074 "To map the entire region $Δ$ onto the $xy$-plane, we consider the transformation of each side. However, in this case, we consider only the side ${S}_{3}.$\n\nFor the side ${S}_{3},$ we have $v=1$ and $1\\ge u\\ge 0.$ Substituting $v=1$ into our transformation equations, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x,y) & =T(u,v) \\\\  & =(v,\\,u-{v}^{2}) \\\\  & =(1,\\,u-{1}^{2}) \\\\  & =(1,\\,u-1).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the image of ${S}_{3}$ can be parametrized by\n\n$$\nx=1,\\,y=u-1,\\,1\\ge u\\ge 0.\n$$\n\n \n\nWriting this in the usual notation, we have\n\n$$\nx(t)=1,\\,y(t)=t-1,\\,1\\ge t\\ge 0.\n$$\n\nThis is a vertical line segment with endpoints $(1,0)$ and $(1,-1)$ in the $xy$-plane.\n\n![](images/4c/4cda505c17437f64f8ab90dcccca1f55f087af77be6dee0e7c81dbd372760664.png)" 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186157615 1068 #edb/ref 17592186153934 13194139534798 17592186045417 false] [17592186157615 1071 "![](images/33/33e48fa5bdbb034bcf489e038ccf80fc5f67baabeccacc1b7abd741183ebf05d.png)\n\nConsider the square region $Δ$ in the $uv$-plane, given by\n\n$$\nΔ=\\{(u,v)\\,:\\,0\\le u\\le 1,\\,0\\le v\\le 1\\},\n$$\n\nand the transformation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT:(u,v)\\to (x(u,v),y(u,v)),\n$$\n\nwhere \n\n$$\nx={u}^{2}+{v}^{2},\\,y=-v.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following is the image of the side ${S}_{2}$ under the action of $T?$" 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186157615 1071 "![](images/33/33e48fa5bdbb034bcf489e038ccf80fc5f67baabeccacc1b7abd741183ebf05d.png)\n\nConsider the square region $Δ$ in the $uv$-plane, given by\n\n$$\nΔ={(u,v)\\,:\\,0\\le u\\le 1,\\,0\\le v\\le 1},\n$$\n\nand the transformation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT:(u,v)\\to (x(u,v),y(u,v)),\n$$\n\nwhere \n\n$$\nx={u}^{2}+{v}^{2},\\,y=-v.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following is the image of the side ${S}_{2}$ under the action of $T?$" 13194139534798 17592186045417 false] [17592186290419 1071 "![](images/33/33e48fa5bdbb034bcf489e038ccf80fc5f67baabeccacc1b7abd741183ebf05d.png)\n\nConsider the square region $Δ$ and its **directed** boundary $∂Δ$ in the $uv$-plane, where $Δ$ is given by\n\n$$\nΔ=\\{(u,v)\\,:\\,0\\le u\\le 1,\\,0\\le v\\le 1\\},\n$$\n\nand the transformation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT:(u,v)\\to (x(u,v),y(u,v)),\n$$\n\nwhere \n\n$$\nx=\\frac{1}{3}(v+6u),\\,y=\\frac{{v}^{3}-2u}{v+2}.\n$$\n\nThe image of the side ${S}_{1}$ under the action of $T$ is a **directed** line segment. Find the endpoints of this segment, stated in the order that they are traversed." 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186290419 1071 "![](images/33/33e48fa5bdbb034bcf489e038ccf80fc5f67baabeccacc1b7abd741183ebf05d.png)\n\nConsider the square region $Δ$ and its **directed** boundary $∂Δ$ in the $uv$-plane, where $Δ$ is given by\n\n$$\nΔ={(u,v)\\,:\\,0\\le u\\le 1,\\,0\\le v\\le 1},\n$$\n\nand the transformation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT:(u,v)\\to (x(u,v),y(u,v)),\n$$\n\nwhere \n\n$$\nx=\\frac{1}{3}(v+6u),\\,y=\\frac{{v}^{3}-2u}{v+2}.\n$$\n\nThe image of the side ${S}_{1}$ under the action of $T$ is a **directed** line segment. Find the endpoints of this segment, stated in the order that they are traversed." 13194139534798 17592186045417 false] [17592186373902 1071 "![](images/5f/5f91cc8b30f9b764021cd84c374a328c7ffb1287a9f0dc6a211a3fadfac2fdbd.png)\n\nConsider the square region $Δ$ in the $uv$-plane, given by\n\n$$\nΔ=\\{(u,v)\\,:\\,0\\le u\\le 1,\\,0\\le v\\le 1\\}\n$$\n\nand the transformation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT:(u,v)\\to (x(u,v),y(u,v)),\n$$\n\nwhere \n\n$$\nx=u{v}^{2},\\,y={u}^{2}.\n$$\n\nFind the image of $Δ$ under the action of $T.$ \n\n*Hint: You may assume that $T$ h