3194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436386 1083 #uuid "96d545bf-0741-5454-b677-38f6a4355e5f" 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436387 1080 "images/cc/ccd7576940650b3c1ba7a0b0c404b2dc39d287261d77f556f63b8166496c69df.png" 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436387 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045497 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436387 1083 #uuid "afc4090a-a50d-5cfd-b9cf-41e1abf26da6" 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436388 1075 #edb/ref 17592186436378 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436388 1075 #edb/ref 17592186436381 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436388 1075 #edb/ref 17592186436384 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436388 1075 #edb/ref 17592186436385 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436388 1075 #edb/ref 17592186436387 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436388 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436388 1077 "selection" 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436388 1078 #edb/ref 17592186436387 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436388 1079 #uuid "d96343de-f671-5ac9-bcd5-9b8c7a8dc39b" 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436389 1068 #edb/ref 17592186436388 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436389 1069 "q-160631" 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436389 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436389 1071 "![](images/5f/5f91cc8b30f9b764021cd84c374a328c7ffb1287a9f0dc6a211a3fadfac2fdbd.png)\n\nConsider the square region $Δ$ in the $uv$-plane, given by\n\n$$\nΔ=\\{(u,v)\\,:\\,0\\le u\\le 1,\\,0\\le v\\le 1\\}\n$$\n\nand the transformation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT:(u,v)\\to (x(u,v),y(u,v)),\n$$\n\nwhere \n\n$$\nx=u+v,\\,y=-{v}^{2}.\n$$\n\nFind the image of $Δ$ under the action of $T.$ \n\n*Hint: You may assume that $T$ has no critical points in the interior of $Δ.$*" 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436389 1072 #uuid "015f5e64-8ccf-5a6a-8fbf-8ce2c8d20eda" 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436389 1074 "We're told that $T$ has no critical points in the interior of $Δ.$ So, to map the entire region $Δ$ onto the $xy$-plane, we transform each side of $Δ$ separately:\n\n- Consider the image of the side ${S}_{1},$ where we have $v=0$ and $0\\le u\\le 1.$ Substituting $v=0$ into our transformation equations, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x,y) & =T(u,v) &  \\\\  & =(u+v,\\,-{v}^{2}) &  \\\\  & =(u+0,\\,-{0}^{2}) &  \\\\  & =(u,\\,0), & 0\\le u\\le 1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is a horizontal line segment traversed from the point $(0,0)$ to the point $(1,0)$ in the $xy$-plane.\n\n- Consider the image of the side ${S}_{2}.$ Here, we have $u=1$ and $0\\le v\\le 1.$ Substituting $u=1$ into our transformation equations, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x,y) & =T(u,v) &  \\\\  & =(u+v,\\,-{v}^{2}) &  \\\\  & =(1+v,\\,-{v}^{2}), & 0\\le v\\le 1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is a downward-opening parabola traversed from the point $(1,0)$ to the point $(2,-1)$ in the $xy$-plane.\n\n- Consider the image of the side ${S}_{3}.$ Here, we have $v=1$ and $1\\ge u\\ge 0.$ Substituting $v=1$ into our transformation equations, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x,y) & =T(u,v) &  \\\\  & =(u+v,\\,-{v}^{2}) &  \\\\  & =(u+1,\\,-{1}^{2}) &  \\\\  & =(u+1,\\,-1), & 1\\ge u\\ge 0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is a horizontal line segment traversed from the point $(2,-1)$ to the point $(1,-1)$ in the $xy$-plane.\n\n- Consider the image of the side ${S}_{4}.$ Here, we have $u=0$ and $1\\ge v\\ge 0.$ Substituting $u=0$ into our transformation equations, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x,y) & =T(u,v) &  \\\\  & =(u+v,\\,-{v}^{2}) &  \\\\  & =(0+v,\\,-{v}^{2}) &  \\\\  & =(v,\\,-{v}^{2}), & 1\\ge v\\ge 0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \nThis is a downward-opening parabola traversed from the point $(1,-1)$ to the point $(0,0)$ in the $xy$-plane.\n\nDrawing the images of the sides of our square, we obtain the following image of $Δ:$\n\n![](images/cc/ccd7576940650b3c1ba7a0b0c404b2dc39d287261d77f556f63b8166496c69df.png)" 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436390 1058 #edb/ref 17592186436391 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436390 1062 #uuid "01e6ff8f-00df-5949-ac6e-0410dc19e1c8" 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436390 1063 #edb/ref 17592186436389 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436391 1058 #edb/ref 17592186436393 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436391 1062 #uuid "1a287a6a-b990-525b-8eed-0161adc076ba" 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436391 1063 #edb/ref 17592186373902 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436392 1058 #edb/ref 17592186436394 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436392 1062 #uuid "8a728ed1-bdb3-5d79-95ad-38502010151b" 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436392 1063 #edb/ref 17592186157614 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436393 1062 #uuid "c2c63c2f-25ab-55d2-98c6-3bc6cfeeba08" 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436393 1063 #edb/ref 17592186290419 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436394 1058 #edb/ref 17592186436390 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436394 1062 #uuid "fd5f8cf2-cf21-51d5-98dd-cd133c6f5651" 13194139534798 17592186045417 true] [17592186436394 1063 #edb/ref 17592186157615 13194139534798 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"activity-5d1b8939-e94e-5773-a283-f5d685750aa5" 17592186436377 "answer-2082dc17-8677-5072-8728-eb1279bccdcc" 17592186436378 "answer-2b4e018a-bce1-5b10-a192-2b9d54af71ed" 17592186436379 "answer-57862c3c-92cb-58ef-989f-3796b1f3d3f1" 17592186436380 "answer-69783711-c08d-571c-86a6-8b131065e28d" 17592186436381 "answer-809bfe03-d49c-5afa-b88d-848b85922201" 17592186436382 "answer-8166063a-dc78-5f3f-8bf7-0c141a4e8d61" 17592186436383 "answer-816f6705-f146-5bfb-a96a-c00de5846b39" 17592186436384 "answer-8ba99d86-24e8-5ca6-94cd-b5ea2ff49d0e" 17592186436385 "answer-96d545bf-0741-5454-b677-38f6a4355e5f" 17592186436386 "answer-afc4090